    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>*送给所有对自我探索感兴趣的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期分享一下，我是如何从直到弯、从0到1，完成自己的性取向探索的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🩵 本期隐藏嘉宾：A宝 🩵</span></p><span></span><p><span>1️⃣ 钢铁直女？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 从幼儿园开始就发现自己是直女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 早恋终点站：味千拉面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 就当是Taylor Swift的发言吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>2️⃣ 直女微拉：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 与邻居姐姐的可疑行径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> Bi-curious阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span>3️⃣ 第一次喜欢女生：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 相识：Connecting the dots</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">23:03</a> 突然cue刘恋和陈清銮古早故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">28:16</a> 豆瓣天空组投稿事件与心碎瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> TP是模仿男女的关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span>4️⃣ 剪短发之后：我变成T了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 已婚直女闺蜜邀我看《卡罗尔》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> 妄议陈土豆的属性</span></p><span></span><p><span>5️⃣ 我的属性变了，就在去年：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 终于懂了做1的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>6️⃣ 作为酷儿的快乐：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>自我探索</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>没有固定角色的亲密关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>成为少数派的选择</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>意外的bonus</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Casual - Chappell Roan</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈 播客主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴爱笔（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613"><span>微博</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo" data-url="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo"><span>即刻</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999"><span>小红书</span></a><span>，全平台同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经做了8年的互联网海外运营，目前运营着一家出海小公司、一个名叫「姬圈纯元」的视频账号、以及这个名叫「Dead Line」的播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 商务合作:</span></p><span></span><p><span>cloverdc@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
