    <title>姐姐们的恋爱观：要炒菜也要吵架，为爱做J也为爱做小孩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666019e094977a26ef5e57b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666019e094977a26ef5e57b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jun 2024 07:55:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很开心能与「非典型sisters」的主播凯瑞串台🥳 同为亲密关系里的「姐姐」，我们对恋爱观大聊特聊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈本期串台主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>💕凯瑞：十余年大厂打工人，精神独立离弃中女，现在甜甜的恋爱中。未来人生的最大课题是，寻找丁克及LGBT人群的养老方案。凯瑞的播客节目链接：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e307e492a75b08879acf88" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e307e492a75b08879acf88"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:00:54</a> 第一次串台节目，我和凯瑞的个人简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">00:03:58</a> 两对P人情侣是怎么做日常规划的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">00:09:11</a> 亲密关系里的付出和支配是怎么回事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">00:14:48</a> 反差感的情侣真相是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">00:18:56</a> 怎么理解情绪价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">00:23:33</a> 什么是恰到好处的自尊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">00:27:37</a> 藏在情绪下的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">00:30:42</a> 爱笔泉州事件：怎么才算是亲密关系里的公平？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">00:38:29</a> 凯瑞槟城事件：怎么才算是快乐的双人旅行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">00:44:09</a> 凯瑞觉得好的亲密关系范本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3052">00:50:52</a> 从伴侣身上学到的闪光点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3247">00:54:07</a> 有效争吵是需要吵后执行跟进的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3446">00:57:26</a> 怎么算分享欲太高或者太低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">01:01:50</a> 非暴力沟通的实用句式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">01:07:30</a> 如何做吵架中的心态王者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4387">01:13:07</a> 感谢CPA录音棚！设备音质都好绝</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈 播客主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>💕 戴爱笔（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613"><span>微博</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo" data-url="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo"><span>即刻</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999"><span>小红书</span></a><span>，全平台同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾是互联网资深海外运营，目前是一位内容创作者与AIGC创业者，一直是一名女同性恋。很高兴通过声音认识你，2024会用视频与大家多见面🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我只是你的爱人》by Frandé法兰黛</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 商务合作：</span></p><span></span><p><span>cloverdc@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
