  <item>
    <title>32岁，不上班一整年，我学到的5节人生课。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e5678dad514f3bc82b3f2d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e5678dad514f3bc82b3f2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Mar 2024 06:17:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>胖了10斤、好友自杀、原生家庭危机……相比之下，不上班好像是今年发生在我身上的事里面最平淡的那一个。不过感谢不上班，给我提供了一个视角，去重新审视我的周遭，我也从中体会到了显化的力量和灵性的成长。这期有些科学也有些玄学，祝收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 【第1节课】你的身体会替你说不。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> 我的职场drama得像在演《继承之战》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 你的身体会帮你请病假吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 职场PUA也会给大脑造成创伤回路</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> 【第2节课】亲历了朋友的死亡之后，我有了用自己热爱的方式活下去的勇气。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> Bada Kitchen和逗思都吃：我心中的北京美食高地</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 重度抑郁患者的躯体化是什么样的：味觉、睡眠、视觉、内脏</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 为什么说女性主义在救人命</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a> 把每次生病当作死亡和衰老的试用装</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a>【第3节课】父母是我们主动选择的两位人生导师，原生家庭遇到的挑战是我们灵魂成长的机会。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> 在原生家庭的经历是我们通向高我的必经之路</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 我爸是阴谋论，我妈是厌女症：我父母的狭隘是如何帮了我的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">33:48</a> 我爸跟我借了几十万：我知道他们给了我一个更昂贵的东西</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a>【第4节课】停止服美役之后，我找回了自己的主体性。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 我不再消费的3类东西，如何无痛实现消费降级</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2421">40:21</a> 服美役的起心动念是如何让我胖了10斤的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> 经济低迷的情况下，仍然还值得消费的东西</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2784">46:24</a> 法国品牌Intima的</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/CqnWApet7aQ/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/p/CqnWApet7aQ/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA=="><span>Instagram帖子</span></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a> Dead Line 听友专属福利，适用于Intima Pro乳酸护理液200ml*2瓶：</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨福利一：Dead Line听友专属30元优惠券：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>优惠券的3种领取方式，选择任意一种都可领取：</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>1️⃣ 点击专属链接：</span><a href="http://mtw.so/5GgRF9" data-url="http://mtw.so/5GgRF9"><span>mtw.so</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2️⃣ 复制淘口令：97💲llI4WL8qOFd₴ </span><a href="https://m.tb.cn/h.5yOdkku" data-url="https://m.tb.cn/h.5yOdkku"><span>m.tb.cn</span></a><span> MF7997 DEAD LINE专属</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>3️⃣在🍑搜索【Intima海外旗舰店】给客服报暗号“Dead Line”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>✨福利二：Dead Line听友免单活动：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>所有下单的听友，可以在评论区贴上单号，2024年3月31日12点，我将在评论区抽取一位幸运听友获得免单福利（免单将以退运费险的形式）。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsur7PM2AHH2IJG6uo22054EKhVH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a>【第5节课】我终于懂了旅行的意义。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3139">52:19</a> 强推清迈Zabb E Lee Cooking School</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> 素食主义者烹饪同学和我在小说里读到的素食者</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3433">57:13</a> 显化、种子、时间</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>🌈 播客主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴爱笔（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613"><span>微博</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo" data-url="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo"><span>即刻</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999"><span>小红书</span></a><span>，全平台同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾是互联网资深海外运营，目前是一位内容创作者与AIGC创业者，一直是一名女同性恋。很高兴通过声音认识你，2024会用视频与大家多见面🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖 本期书单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《身体从未忘记》by Bessel van der Kolk M.D.</span></p><span></span><p><span>《超越百岁》by Peter Attia</span></p><span></span><p><span>《生命的不可思议》by 胡因梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>《服美役》by Maura Gancitano</span></p><span></span><p><span>《身体会替你说不》by Gabor Maté</span></p><span></span><p><span>《身体由我》by Sheila de Liz</span></p><span></span><p><span>《素食者》by 韩江 </span><br><span></span><br><span>《Manifest》by Roxie Nafousi</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>《With My Eyes Closed》by The Raveonettes</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 监制Live by Somg</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 商务合作：</span></p><span></span><p><span>cloverdc@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
