    <title>1月读了15本书：我是如何戒断社交媒体，重拾专注力。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c9ca513af97665afd33132</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c9ca513af97665afd33132</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Feb 2024 07:35:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从社媒ADHD到读书成瘾，我都经历了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 一种假性知识分子生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 鹦鹉史航事件对我的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 这期播客想说什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 快乐的猪 vs 痛苦的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 本末倒置的学习假象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 模仿欲望的陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 如何批量生产精神病人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a> 戒断社媒的两个错误方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 如何像刷朋友圈一样刷书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 高分好书不代表适合你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> 如何找到适合自己的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">43:24</a> 两个增强专注的App</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a> 不刷社媒带来的负面影响</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧘 相关App：</span></p><span></span><p><span>专注App：专注旅人</span></p><span></span><p><span>冥想App：Headspace</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖 相关书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36247880/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36247880/"><span>成瘾</span></a><span>》by Anna Lembke</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36246334/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36246334/"><span>模仿欲望</span></a><span>》by Luke Burgis</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26304954/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26304954/"><span>存在主义心理治疗</span></a><span>》by</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>Irvin Yalom</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34895571/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34895571/"><span>饱食穷民</span></a><span>》by 斋藤茂男</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35876121/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35876121/"><span>纳瓦尔宝典</span></a><span>》by Eric Jorgenson</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Silently》by Blonde RedHead</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈 播客主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴爱笔（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613"><span>微博</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo" data-url="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo"><span>即刻</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999"><span>小红书</span></a><span>，全平台同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾是互联网资深海外运营，目前是一位创作者与创业者，也是一名女同性恋。很高兴通过声音认识你，2024会用视频与大家多见面🤗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 商务合作：</span></p><span></span><p><span>cloverdc@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
