    <title>情绪自由的人最有魅力，我们来吵一场喵喵架吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658e418fb8fd2bc060308322</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658e418fb8fd2bc060308322</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Dec 2023 03:48:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近发现了一种不上火的吵架方法，斗胆取名叫喵喵架，解决了我和A宝在吵架中互相伤害的情况。这种沟通方式容易引发双方的同理心，在照顾自己情绪的同时，也能看见更多对方的诉求，让我们在不断练习中成长为情绪自由的人。</span><br><span></span><br><span>🌈 播客主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴爱笔（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613"><span>微博</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo" data-url="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo"><span>即刻</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999"><span>小红书</span></a><span>，全平台同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾是互联网资深海外运营，目前是一位内容创作者与AIGC创业者，一直是一名女同性恋。很高兴通过声音认识你，2024会用视频与大家多见面🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 和A宝同居的开心事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 同居最大的困扰：高频争吵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> 痛定思痛：经过学习我以后只吵喵喵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 负面情绪来临，化学递质怒发冲冠的前5秒</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 亲身实践：一边生气一边吃蟹黄锅巴</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 做情绪的主人：需要对自己的情绪负责</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 亲身经历：被当众羞辱但并不生气</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a> 和自己吵喵喵架：写情绪日记</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 我的情绪日记案例：洗碗机事件</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 有毒的思考方式：给人和事情下定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a> 善意假设帮我们看到更多可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 和别人吵喵喵架：听和说同样重要</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 用非暴力沟通四步走来表达自己</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 需要了解自己喜欢的「爱的语言」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> 做好一个倾听者的常见误区</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 从小笼罩在父母吵架的阴影中，别怕</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：《Hellhole Ratrace》by Girls</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖本期书单：《非暴力沟通》、《怎样说孩子才会听，怎样听孩子才肯说》、《爱的五种语言》、《我们内心的冲突》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 商务合作：</span></p><span></span><p><span>cloverdc@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
