  <item>
    <title>深陷PUA和煤气灯的我们，如何在发疯与逃避中走出黑暗。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6563e7f2c9e7cfe02519b542</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6563e7f2c9e7cfe02519b542</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Nov 2023 00:50:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我遭遇了严重的职场PUA，而Becky遭遇了严重的情场煤气灯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是我们开始了一场发疯式的旅行：去巴厘岛骂导游、去曼谷看Blackpink的演唱会、去香港和林阿P面基……旅行很快结束，而痛苦和治愈才刚刚开始。</span><br><span></span><br><span>🌈 播客主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴爱笔（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1760340613"><span>微博</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo" data-url="https://okjk.co/9LRzeo"><span>即刻</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=59795feb5e87e71bf09b0f70&amp;apptime=1707723999"><span>小红书</span></a><span>，全平台同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾是互联网资深海外运营，目前是一位内容创作者与AIGC创业者，一直是一名女同性恋。很高兴通过声音认识你，2024会用视频与大家多见面🤗</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>幸运又荒诞的旅程：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 一言难尽的巴厘岛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6JitSPEMXVojvZtNtQFq8yUq8f.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 一言可尽的曼谷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrtR0Zl8g4bCElGUUlBqA14DwAvO.heic"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a> 关于香港我们想的都是my little airport。我最喜欢的是《诗歌舞街》，Becky最喜欢的是《忧伤的嫖客》和《爷就是一名辞职捻》。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlP-gRYBC2qkT63wl1B6lIDCxBQ6.heic"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>后知后觉的治愈：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 陷入精神创伤时，无力反击是常态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 警惕创伤后的「受害者心态」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 遇到恶人、负面遭遇时的好心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 状态差时花小钱办大事的服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> 你有朋友圈被害妄想症吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 看到「谈过50次恋爱」你想的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> 如何机智应对亲人道德绑架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 残忍的美丽和无人欣赏的松弛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a> 拓展人生的宽度，留下不成熟的印记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">40:19</a> 想向日本「抄答案」的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 《The Christmas Song》 - The Raveonettes⛄️</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 商务合作：</span></p><span></span><p><span>cloverdc@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
